"了解一下" = "Learn More";
"简值是什么" = "What SimpleWorth Is";
"简值是一款尽量简单、安静、专注的记账 App，希望把每天的收支、标签、金库目标和统计视图收进一套足够轻盈的体验里。" = "SimpleWorth is a budgeting app designed to stay simple, quiet, and focused, keeping your daily entries, tags, vault goals, and stats in one lightweight experience.";
"它更在意记录时的顺手、回看时的清楚，以及长期使用时的节奏感，所以会尽量减少打扰，让账单、目标和价值增长保持在同一个界面语言里。" = "It cares about fast entry, clear review, and a steady long-term rhythm, so it tries to stay out of your way while keeping bills, goals, and growth in the same visual language.";
"定位" = "Positioning";
"轻量记账与目标管理" = "Lightweight budgeting and goal tracking";
"反馈方式" = "Feedback Options";
"先复制邮箱，再决定是否立刻发送邮件。" = "Copy the address first, then decide whether to send an email right away.";
"系统会先打开邮件草稿，再由你确认是否真的发送。" = "The app opens a draft first, and you decide whether to actually send it.";
"Excel 模板" = "Excel Template";
"下载后可以直接用 Excel、WPS 或 Numbers 打开，按行填写自己的账单，再把这张表导回简值。" = "Download the template, open it in Excel, WPS, or Numbers, fill in your bills row by row, then import the sheet back into SimpleWorth.";
"模板实际保存为通用 CSV 表格，兼容大多数表格软件。" = "The template is saved as a universal CSV table that works with most spreadsheet apps.";
"下载 Excel 模板" = "Download Excel Template";
"真实案例" = "Real Example";
"下面这两行就是模板里的真实填写案例，你只需要照着改日期、分类、金额、备注和标签。" = "These two rows are real examples from the template. Just replace the date, category, amount, note, and tags with your own data.";
"2026-03-18 08:32 | 支出 | 交通 | 6 | CNY | 早高峰地铁通勤 | 通勤/上班" = "2026-03-18 08:32 | Expense | Transport | 6 | CNY | Morning subway commute | Commute/Work";
"2026-03-25 19:40 | 收入 | 工资 | 9800 | CNY | 3 月工资 | 工资/固定收入" = "2026-03-25 19:40 | Income | Salary | 9800 | CNY | March salary | Salary/Fixed income";
"填写说明" = "How to Fill It";
"日期支持“2026-03-18 08:32”或“2026-03-18”这类写法；如果只写日期，系统会按当天默认时间导入。" = "Dates support formats like “2026-03-18 08:32” or “2026-03-18”. If you provide only a date, the app imports it with a default time for that day.";
"类型填写“支出”或“收入”；分类建议直接使用简值里已有的分类名称。" = "Set Type to Expense or Income. For Category, it’s best to use names that already exist in SimpleWorth.";
"标签可用“/”分隔，例如“通勤/上班”；模板里没有的标签会自动帮你创建。" = "Separate tags with “/”, such as “Commute/Work”. Tags that do not exist yet will be created automatically.";
"如果币种不是 CNY，系统会按当前已缓存的汇率自动折算成人民币。" = "If the currency is not CNY, the app will convert it to CNY using the currently cached exchange rate.";
"开始导入" = "Start Import";
"导入只会追加新的账单，不会清空你当前已有的数据；如果模板里有完全相同的账单行，会自动跳过。" = "Import only adds new entries and never clears your current data. Fully identical rows in the template are skipped automatically.";
"选择 Excel 导入文件" = "Choose Excel Import File";
"无法读取导入文件，请确认是 UTF-8 或常见文本编码的表格文件。" = "The import file could not be read. Make sure it is a UTF-8 or other common text-encoded spreadsheet file.";
"导入文件为空，请先填写模板内容。" = "The import file is empty. Fill in the template first.";
"导入表头不正确，请使用简值提供的模板文件。" = "The header row is invalid. Please use the template provided by SimpleWorth.";
"没有读取到可导入的账单行，请先在模板里填写至少一条账单。" = "No bill rows were found to import. Add at least one row to the template first.";
