"iCloud 状态" = "iCloud Status";
"开启后会把账单、标签、金库目标和存入记录同步到当前设备的 iCloud 私有数据库，并每天自动保留一份本地备份。" = "When enabled, your ledger data stays on this device, and new backup files are also saved to the iCloud account currently signed in on this device.";
"开启后会继续保留本机备份，并把新的备份文件自动同步保存到当前 Apple 账号的 iCloud 中，方便在同账号设备上恢复。" = "When enabled, local backups remain on this device, and new backup files are also mirrored to the current Apple account's iCloud for restore on your other devices.";
"关闭后不会影响当前账单内容，只会停止把新的备份文件继续同步到 iCloud。恢复备份会覆盖当前设备上的账单数据，建议先确认现在的内容已经保存。" = "Turning it off does not change your current ledger data. It only stops syncing new backup files to iCloud. Restoring a backup will overwrite the data currently stored on this device, so make sure your latest changes are already saved.";
"开启后，新的备份文件会同时保存在本机和当前 Apple 账号的 iCloud，方便在同账号设备上恢复。" = "When enabled, new backup files are saved both on this device and in the current Apple account's iCloud, making restore easier on your other devices signed in with the same account.";
"关闭后不会影响当前账单内容，只会停止后续备份同步到 iCloud。恢复备份会覆盖当前设备上的账单数据，建议先确认现在的内容已经保存。" = "Turning it off does not affect your current ledger data. It only stops future backups from syncing to iCloud. Restoring a backup will overwrite the data currently stored on this device, so make sure your latest changes are already saved.";
"开启 iCloud 自动备份后，新的备份文件会同步保存到你当前 Apple 账号的 iCloud。" = "After iCloud Auto Backup is enabled, new backup files are also saved to the iCloud account currently signed in.";
